# landmark (assets/world3d/ruins/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# The Old Watch: the broken watchtower stump on the back edge with its dark
# doorway and a tattered flag, ruined curtain wall running east and a
# broken turret.
cylinder stone   at 128 0 -9 size 50 48 50 id ruins-tower
